<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora{% endif %}">NEVORA</a></p><h1 class="t1 rise">Delete your NEVORA account</h1><p class="lede fade">You can ask us to delete your NEVORA account and the information linked to it, in the app or on the web.</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#p-0">In the app or on the web</a><a href="#p-1">What happens next</a><a href="#p-2">What is removed</a><a href="#p-3">What may be kept</a><a href="#p-4">Your job and your workplace</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">Also for NEVORA</p><nav aria-label="Other NEVORA pages"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-terms{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-terms{% endif %}">NEVORA terms of use</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-support{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-support{% endif %}">NEVORA support</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="p-0"><i>01</i><h2>In the app or on the web</h2><p>In the app:</p><ol><li>Open <strong>Profile</strong>.</li><li>Choose <strong>Delete my account</strong>.</li><li>Read what is removed and what may be kept.</li><li>Re-enter your password and confirm.</li></ol><p>If you’ve uninstalled the app, sign in to NEVORA on the web at your workplace’s address and do the same; the page opens after you sign in.</p><p>If you can’t sign in, use <strong>Forgot access</strong> first, or email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> and we’ll help you confirm it’s you.</p></section><section id="p-1"><i>02</i><h2>What happens next</h2><p>When you confirm, we save your request and show you a reference such as DEL‑7KQ2M9XA. You’re signed out on every device and can’t sign in again. We aim to delete your account within 30 calendar days after we receive the request, and we email you when it’s done if we have your email address. Quote your reference to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> to ask about it.</p></section><section id="p-2"><i>03</i><h2>What is removed</h2><p>Your account and the information linked to it that can be deleted: your profile, sign-in details, sessions, notification subscriptions, calendar feed links and the content you contributed, including copies held by our service providers.</p></section><section id="p-3"><i>04</i><h2>What may be kept</h2><p>Some attendance, payroll, security or dispute records may have to be kept for a recorded obligation. We keep:</p><ul><li><strong>Attendance, approved timecards, payroll calculations, published pay statements</strong> and their corrections and approvals: three years from the record’s final entry.</li><li><strong>Records supporting employment taxes:</strong> at least four years after the tax is due or paid, whichever is later.</li><li><strong>Security and access logs:</strong> up to 90 days.</li><li><strong>Records of privacy requests:</strong> 24 months after the request is closed.</li><li><strong>Records under a legal hold or unresolved dispute:</strong> until the hold is released and the applicable period has passed.</li></ul><p>The longest applicable period applies, and a deletion request doesn’t restart it. Backups: Our database keeps a restore history of six hours. We are verifying the maximum time any backup or exported copy is kept, and will update this policy once it is confirmed. Kept records are restricted and never used to restore your account.</p></section><section id="p-4"><i>05</i><h2>Your job and your workplace</h2><p>Deleting your NEVORA account doesn’t end your employment or remove records your employer has to keep. If you’re the Owner, your company’s workspace stays open for the rest of your team; closing a workspace is separate, so email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> to arrange it. A free trial workplace that ends on day 30 without a plan is deleted, all of it, within 3 days, including attendance, timecards and pay statements; the retention periods above apply to workplaces on a plan.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-support{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-support{% endif %}">NEVORA support</a></div></div></div></div></section>
